{
  "info": {
    "name": "Database Health Monitor",
    "description": "Every REST endpoint of the Database Health Monitor, grouped the same way as Swagger UI (http://localhost:8080/swagger-ui.html) and the bruno/ collection.\n\nCollection variables (edit under the collection's Variables tab, or override with an environment):\n  baseUrl        default http://localhost:8080\n  adminUser      default fares\n  adminPassword  default fares\n\nEvery GET /api/** is a read; some require login depending on live policy (see GET /api/admin/policies). Every non-GET /api/** endpoint uses HTTP Basic auth with adminUser / adminPassword - those requests already inherit it from the folder/collection.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Activity",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Recent Snapshots",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/activity/snapshots?limit=20",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "activity",
                "snapshots"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "20"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "List recent activity snapshots (the monitor service's own JVM/HTTP activity), newest first."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Latest Snapshot",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/activity/snapshots/latest",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "activity",
                "snapshots",
                "latest"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Get the most recent activity snapshot."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Latest HTTP",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/activity/snapshots/latest/http",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "activity",
                "snapshots",
                "latest",
                "http"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Just the HTTP request section of the latest activity snapshot."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Latest JVM",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/activity/snapshots/latest/jvm",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "activity",
                "snapshots",
                "latest",
                "jvm"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Just the JVM (heap/memory) section of the latest activity snapshot."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Admin",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Collect Now",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/collect",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "admin",
                "collect"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Run every collector right now instead of waiting for the next scheduled cycle, then re-evaluate thresholds.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "basic",
              "basic": [
                {
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "{{adminUser}}",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "{{adminPassword}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Purge Now",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/purge",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "admin",
                "purge"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Run the retention purge right now instead of waiting for its schedule.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "basic",
              "basic": [
                {
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "{{adminUser}}",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "{{adminPassword}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Thresholds",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/thresholds",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "admin",
                "thresholds"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Get the current health-check threshold values. Public read, per SecurityConfig."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Thresholds",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/thresholds",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "admin",
                "thresholds"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Change one or more health-check thresholds live, no redeploy needed - PATCH semantics, send only the fields you want to change. All fields (all optional): diskWarnPercent, diskCritPercent, longTransactionSeconds, slowQueryRatePerMin, tmpDiskTableRatePerMin, bufferPoolHitRatioWarnPercent, bufferPoolHitRatioCritPercent, connectionWarnPercent, connectionCritPercent, latencySigmaK, collectionGapSeconds, baselineWindow, openAfter, resolveAfter.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "basic",
              "basic": [
                {
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "{{adminUser}}",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "{{adminPassword}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"diskWarnPercent\": 85\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Policies",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/policies",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "admin",
                "policies"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Get the current cache/protection policy flags for every metric key. Public read, per SecurityConfig."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Policy",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/policies/:key",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "admin",
                "policies",
                ":key"
              ],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "key": "key",
                  "value": "database.latest"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Change one metric's cache/protection flags live, no redeploy needed. Set :key to a real metric key from \"Get Policies\" first (e.g. database.latest). Both body fields are optional.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "basic",
              "basic": [
                {
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "{{adminUser}}",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "{{adminPassword}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"cached\": true,\n  \"protectedAccess\": false\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "AI Agent",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Ask Agent",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/agent/ask",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "agent",
                "ask"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Ask the AI health-assessment agent a plain-English question about the monitored database, using only real data from its own tools. Try also: \"what queries are running right now?\", \"any security issues?\", \"why is it slow?\".\n\nRate-limited to 5 requests/minute, separate from the rest of the API. First response can take 10-30s depending on the configured backend.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "basic",
              "basic": [
                {
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "{{adminUser}}",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "{{adminPassword}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"question\": \"is the database healthy?\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
